      <h2 id="score-title" class="section__title">What's a First Nest score?</h2>
      <p>It's our own rating out of 5, not Amazon's star rating. Every pick is scored on four things that matter in a small, rented room:</p>
      <ul class="score-criteria">
        <li><b>Value</b> What you get for the price, compared with alternatives.</li>
        <li><b>Small-space fit</b> Size, footprint and how well it works in a tiny room.</li>
        <li><b>Renter-friendly</b> No drilling, no damage, no lost deposit.</li>
        <li><b>Real reviews</b> Consistent feedback from verified buyers over time.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
